# Letter from the Guest Editor: Digital Rhetoric, Digital Literacy, Computers, and Composition.

**Authors:** Handa, Carolyn

## Abstract
Describes how this special issue collects a group of thought-provoking essays to encourage both writing teachers and the members of the more specialized field of Computers and Writing to consider questions of digital rhetoric and literacy in their many applications to subjects thought about everyday: pedagogy, professional writing, hypertext theory, rhetorical studies, and the future of Composition Studies. (SG)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ624545

